---
// English About Page
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" lang="en">
  <div class="about container">
    <h1>About SimuLearn</h1>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>What is this?</h2>
      <p>
        SimuLearn is a personal learning site focused on <strong>structural simulation</strong> and
        <strong>Finite Element Analysis (FEA)</strong>. I document my learning journey, share software tutorials,
        write book notes, and explore using AI to assist with simulation challenges.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Why this site?</h2>
      <p>
        During my journey learning structural simulation, I found that many concepts are easy to forget, and mistakes
        tend to repeat. Rather than scattering notes across different places, I built a systematic learning platform —
        both for my own reference and to help others with similar interests.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Content Focus</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Software Tutorials</strong>: ANSYS, Abaqus, and domestic FEA software guides</li>
        <li><strong>Book Notes</strong>: In-depth notes on classic structural simulation textbooks</li>
        <li><strong>Learning Notes</strong>: Learning paths, methodologies, and resource recommendations</li>
        <li><strong>Challenges</strong>: Specific simulation problems and their solutions</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Tech Stack</h2>
      <p>
        This site is built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank">Astro</a> and deployed on
        Cloudflare Pages. Articles are written in Markdown and version-controlled with Git.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have suggestions, want to discuss a simulation problem, or found an error in an article,
        feel free to reach out:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>GitHub: <a href="#">(to be filled)</a></li>
        <li>Email: <a href="#">(to be filled)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about { max-width: var(--max-width); }
  .about h1 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); }
  .about-section { margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); }
  .about-section h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; border: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
</style>
